@startuml
title Cooperative Market Order Flow

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor Customer
participant "Cooperative Storefront" as Storefront
participant "Cart / Checkout" as Checkout
participant "Pricing Service" as Pricing
participant "Order Service" as Orders
participant "Member Merchant A" as MerchantA
participant "Member Merchant B" as MerchantB
participant "Sequo Consolidation" as Consolidation
participant "Delivery / Relay" as Delivery
participant "Settlement Service" as Settlements

Customer -> Storefront : Browse cooperative market
Storefront -> Checkout : Add products from multiple members
Checkout -> Pricing : quote one customer-facing package
Pricing --> Checkout : quote with per-item merchant ownership
Customer -> Checkout : Pay checkout
Checkout -> Orders : create customer order
Orders -> Orders : split sub-orders by merchant_id
Orders -> MerchantA : sub-order SC-A
Orders -> MerchantB : sub-order SC-B
MerchantA -> Orders : accept and prepare
MerchantB -> Orders : accept and prepare
Orders -> Consolidation : create package manifest
Consolidation -> Delivery : hand off one consolidated package
Delivery -> Customer : deliver or route to relay
Delivery -> Orders : delivery/customer pickup confirmed
Orders -> Settlements : settle per item owner
Settlements -> MerchantA : payout net of A commission/refunds
Settlements -> MerchantB : payout net of B commission/refunds

note right of Orders
The customer can see one cooperative package,
but backend order items, commissions, refunds,
and payouts retain the true merchant owner.
end note

@enduml

